<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκάμᾰτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of easy labour, easy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					66
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. στέφανοι</span> crowns <i>won by
				noble toils,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.335
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>easily enduring fatigue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>laborious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					5.483
				</span></i>
			; <i>caused by toil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱδρῶτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					25.28
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
